cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper and this software."
title: "Prediction intervals for calibration-free cuffless blood pressure: analysis code"
authors:
  - family-names: Fukushima
    given-names: Hayato
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-3776-1158"
license: MIT
type: software
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a study of conformal prediction intervals for blood pressure estimated from the
  photoplethysmogram (PPG) alone, without per-person calibration. It evaluates patient-level coverage within
  VitalDB and on MIMIC-III. Data are not included; the code downloads them from the original sources.
keywords:
  - cuffless blood pressure
  - photoplethysmography
  - conformal prediction
  - prediction interval
  - dataset shift
version: 1.0.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Hayato-F110/ppg-bp-prediction-intervals"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23513091"  # version v1.0.0; all versions: 10.5281/zenodo.23513090
